 ```
 
+## API
+
+### parseMilliseconds(milliseconds, options?)
+
+#### options
+
+##### largestUnit
+
+Type: `'days' | 'hours' | 'minutes' | 'seconds'`\
+Default: `'days'`
+
+The largest unit to use. Bigger units roll into it, so `{largestUnit: 'hours'}` gives `hours: 26` instead of `days: 1, hours: 2`. The bigger units are `0`.
+
+Throws a `TypeError` for any other value.
+
